# Phase 1 — Requirement Intake

**Objective:** Clarify and normalize the raw requirement into a precise, anchorable Requirement Brief that all later phases build from.

---

## Core Problem & Business Goal

**Core problem:** Expense approvers receive invoices in heterogeneous formats (PDF, scanned image, structured data) and must manually verify each one for accuracy, authenticity, and policy compliance before approval. This is slow, inconsistent, error-prone, and vulnerable to fraud (duplicates, altered amounts, fake vendors).

**Business/user goal:** Provide approvers with a fast, consistent, explainable **reliability assessment** of each invoice — extracting key fields, validating authenticity signals, and flagging risk — so humans can approve confidently and quickly. The agent is a **decision-support tool**, never an auto-approver.

---

## Success Metrics

| Category | Metric | Target |
|---|---|---|
| Extraction accuracy | Field-level extraction accuracy (vendor, amount, date, tax, currency) | ≥ 95% on clean docs; ≥ 85% on scanned/low-quality |
| Line-item accuracy | Line-item capture completeness | ≥ 90% |
| Fraud/risk detection | Duplicate invoice detection recall | ≥ 98% |
| Fraud/risk detection | Suspicious-invoice flagging precision | ≥ 80% (limit false alarms) |
| Decision support | Approver agreement with reliability score (spot-audit) | ≥ 90% |
| Efficiency | Median processing time per invoice | ≤ 30s (see latency constraint) |
| Efficiency | Reduction in manual review time per invoice | ≥ 50% vs baseline |
| Safety | Auto-approval incidents | 0 (hard requirement) |
| Trust | Explanation usefulness rating from approvers | ≥ 4/5 |

> *Baselines (current manual review time, current fraud leakage rate) are open questions — see below.*

---

## In Scope vs Out of Scope

### In Scope
- Ingestion of invoices as **PDF, image (JPG/PNG/TIFF), and structured data** (JSON/XML/CSV/EDI).
- **Field extraction:** vendor, total amount, invoice date, line items, tax, currency; plus invoice number, PO number, due date where present.
- **Authenticity validation:** format/layout consistency, vendor registry lookup, duplicate detection.
- **Policy compliance checks** against configured expense policy rules.
- **Multi-currency** handling and normalization.
- **Reliability score** (structured) with a **human-readable explanation** and itemized flags.
- Integration with the **vendor database** and **expense policy rule engine**.
- Output to the **expense approval workflow** for human decision.

### Out of Scope
- **Auto-approval or auto-rejection** of any invoice (hard exclusion).
- Payment execution / disbursement.
- Vendor onboarding or vendor master data management (read-only consumer of vendor DB).
- Accounting/GL posting and ERP journal entries.
- Tax filing, regulatory tax computation, or legal tax advice.
- Contract/PO lifecycle management (consume PO data; do not manage it).
- Negotiation or communication with vendors.
- Historical bulk re-scoring of legacy invoices (unless later requested).

