| Role | Relationship | Interest |
|---|---|---|
| **Expense approvers / managers** | Primary user | Fast, trustworthy reliability signal to approve/decline |
| **AP (Accounts Payable) clerks** | Primary user | Triage and exception handling |
| **Finance controllers** | Stakeholder | Fraud reduction, audit trail, policy enforcement |
| **Internal audit / compliance** | Stakeholder | Explainability, traceability, control evidence |
| **Procurement** | Stakeholder | Vendor data accuracy, PO matching |
