### Data Flow (summary)
1. **Intake →** Orchestrator receives invoice + metadata; creates a job with an audit ID.
2. **Extraction →** Ingestion & Extraction Agent classifies format, runs OCR if needed, extracts fields with per-field confidence; normalizes currency via FX tool.
3. **Verification (parallel) →** Four specialists run concurrently against external systems, each returning structured evidence + sub-signals.
4. **Scoring →** Deterministic engine aggregates evidence into a reliability score, sub-scores, and itemized flags using configurable weights.
5. **Explanation →** Narrative Agent produces a grounded, human-readable explanation strictly from the evidence bundle (no new facts).
6. **Handoff →** Output boundary emits a structured payload to the approval workflow — **decision-support only**.

### External Systems / Tools
| External system | Interaction | Direction |
|---|---|---|
| OCR engine (e.g., cloud OCR / Textract-class) | Text + layout extraction from images/PDFs | Call out |
| Vendor database | Vendor identity, tax ID, bank/payment verification | Read |
| Historical invoice store | Duplicate / near-duplicate lookup | Read |
| Expense policy rule engine | Compliance evaluation | Read / evaluate |
| FX rate source | Currency normalization (daily reference) | Read |
| Approval workflow / expense UI | Output sink for structured assessment | Write (advisory) |
| Audit / trace store | Immutable record of inputs, evidence, scores, flags | Write |
| PII vault / encrypted store | Secure storage of invoice + PII | Read/Write |

