### 5.2 Memory tiers

| Tier | Scope | Contents | Persistence |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Working memory** | Single job, in-flight | `JobContext` | State store (TTL until job completes + grace) |
| **Audit memory** | Permanent, immutable | All inputs, evidence, score derivation, prompts+model versions, timestamps | Audit/trace store (WORM, retention per compliance) |
